  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Encouraged by Chun Yuqiao's support, Bu Xiaogu asks what obstacles stand in the way of revamping Twelve Singers—and then summons her courage before heading home. Listen to their Mandarin dialogue.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我们现在都有哪些阻力呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们是一个团队，大家一起想办法。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这些阻力一定可以被解决掉的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我们现在呢，主要有三大阻力。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "广告商、电视台，还有艺人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这不是咱们所有的合作方吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这就相当于全世界都在反对我们。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "差不多就是这样吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我还要加班，你赶紧回去吧，那么晚了注意安全。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好的，谢谢淳于总。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "师兄，你明天有没有时间一起喝东西？",
      "gap": 0.9
