    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "广告商、电视台，还有艺人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The advertisers, the television station, and the artists.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这不是咱们所有的合作方吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are those not every single one of our partners?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这就相当于全世界都在反对我们。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
