      "t": "'More or less.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我还要加班，你赶紧回去吧，那么晚了注意安全。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I still have overtime work; hurry on home and stay safe this late at night.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
